Error [E0381]: a trailing `on` clause isn't how a marker states a fact
  --> tests/ui/marker_decl_rejected_forms.jet:6:29
    |
  6 | marker Inline(mode: String) on [.Function]
    |                             ^^
 Why: D-META-FORM1=A: a fact about the rule (its legal sites, whether it repeats) is an ordinary named parameter in the same list, marked with the compile-time `$` sigil — not a clause after the list
 Fix: move the sites into the parameter list as `$sites: [.Function, …]`

Error [E0381]: a second parameter list isn't how a marker states a fact
  --> tests/ui/marker_decl_rejected_forms.jet:8:30
    |
  8 | marker Pre(condition: String)(sites: [.Function])
    |                              ^
 Why: D-META-FORM1=A: the rule's own arguments and facts about the rule share one named-parameter list, told apart by the compile-time `$` sigil — not two parameter lists
 Fix: fold the second list's facts into the first as `$sites: […]`, `$repeatable: true`

Error [E0381]: a scope block isn't how a marker states a fact
  --> tests/ui/marker_decl_rejected_forms.jet:10:31
    |
 10 | marker Unsafe(reason: String) {
    |                               ^
 Why: D-META-FORM1=A: a fact about the rule is an ordinary `$`-marked named parameter in the declaration's own parameter list — not a member line in a trailing block
 Fix: write the facts as parameters, e.g. `$sites: [.Function, …], $repeatable: true`
